#Object Name: Camellia
#File Name: camela01.plg
#Author: Sean Ziegeler
#Date: 10/25/95
#Description: A plant with a flower that resembles a Camellia.  It was made
#             using L-systems.
#Comments: It has 4 indexible colors.  This is helpful if you want a fall
#          version of the plant you can map some of the colors to be yellow
#          or red if you want "fall-looking" leaves.  If you just want a
#          normal plant, make all indices green.  However, color index
#          4 is the flower and it doesn't look that well green.

